# Docker env file of the stack (TEXERA_DOCKER_ENV_FILE), from bin/single-node/.env with this stack's ports.
# render.py copies it to <stack dir>/infra.env (mode 600) when that file is missing. Fill the provider keys;
# every other value is the repository's public local-dev default.
